OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells, the sunshine
OL,7,Fturning occasionally hazy. One or two
OL,8,Fbrief showers are possible at times. A
OL,9,Fvery warm day. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay mostly dry
OL,12,Fovernight with a few clear spells at
OL,13,Ftimes and just the small chance of the
OL,14,Fodd brief shower.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FAnother very warm day.
OL,17,FMainly dry and bright with some sunny
OL,18,Fspells, though the sunshine turning
OL,19,Fhazy at times. Chance of the odd heavy
OL,20,Fshower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
